{"id":"522587a7fec6816a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-dimension.md","title":"Dimension","display":"df-dimension — Dimension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dimension","aliases":["58-df-dimension"],"display":"df-dimension — Dimension","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dimension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dimension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dimension — Dimension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V,W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal V,W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V=\\langle W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal V=\\langle W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\)</span> (fully explicit vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Basis}_S,\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Basis}_S,\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dimension\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal V)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal V=\\langle W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land0_W\\in W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\bigl(+_W(\\langle0_W,w\\rangle)=w\\land+_W(\\langle w,0_W\\rangle)=w\\bigr)\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in F^{\\mathcal B}\\;\\Bigl(\\left|\\{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F\\}\\right|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\sum_{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F}^{+_W}\\odot(\\langle c(b),b\\rangle)=0_W\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B\\;(c(b)=0_F)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\exists c\\in F^{\\mathcal B}\\;\\Bigl(\\left|\\{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F\\}\\right|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land w=\\sum_{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F}^{+_W}\\odot(\\langle c(b),b\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dimension\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal V)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal V=\\langle W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land0_W\\in W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\bigl(+_W(\\langle0_W,w\\rangle)=w\\land+_W(\\langle w,0_W\\rangle)=w\\bigr)\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in F^{\\mathcal B}\\;\\Bigl(\\left|\\{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F\\}\\right|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\sum_{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F}^{+_W}\\odot(\\langle c(b),b\\rangle)=0_W\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B\\;(c(b)=0_F)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\exists c\\in F^{\\mathcal B}\\;\\Bigl(\\left|\\{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F\\}\\right|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land w=\\sum_{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F}^{+_W}\\odot(\\langle c(b),b\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal V)\\land\\kappa=\\lvert\\mathcal B\\rvert\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal V)\\land\\kappa=\\lvert\\mathcal B\\rvert\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The structure tuple keeps the carrier, scalar field, both additions, scalar multiplication, field multiplication and distinguished units in the predicate signature.</li>\n<li>Dimension is the cardinality of any basis of that fixed vector-space structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)$ (fully explicit vector-space predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V,W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V=\\langle W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Basis}_S,\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dimension\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal V)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal V=\\langle W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_W\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,F,+_W,\\odot,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land0_W\\in W\\\\\n&\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\bigl(+_W(\\langle0_W,w\\rangle)=w\\land+_W(\\langle w,0_W\\rangle)=w\\bigr)\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq W\\\\\n&\\land\\forall c\\in F^{\\mathcal B}\\;\\Bigl(\\left|\\{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F\\}\\right|<\\aleph_0\\land\\sum_{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F}^{+_W}\\odot(\\langle c(b),b\\rangle)=0_W\\\\\n&\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B\\;(c(b)=0_F)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\exists c\\in F^{\\mathcal B}\\;\\Bigl(\\left|\\{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F\\}\\right|<\\aleph_0\\land w=\\sum_{b\\in\\mathcal B:c(b)\\neq0_F}^{+_W}\\odot(\\langle c(b),b\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal V)\\land\\kappa=\\lvert\\mathcal B\\rvert\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":2098,"backlinks":[{"id":"7da7ff11e397ca55","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dimension}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]])"},{"id":"c5296856bbf84423","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9ae082208bc5fc2b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"59e53f2a0f1b0898","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"025c5240f130d970","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\subseteq V^2$ is from [[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]."},{"id":"77234e7e1a9081ed","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dimension}_S$ (dimension predicate, see [[58-df-dimension]])"},{"id":"056f7b0dff6c7aee","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-430","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md|58-df-dimension]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2"